Article 3 (Special cases concerning establishment and public notice of national strategy on biodiversity)
Notwithstanding Article 4(3), the Minister of Environment shall establish and publicly notify the first national strategy on biodiversity established after this Decree enters into force, within ten months after this Decree enters into force.
